{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 91937, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 64465, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "暴击机制科普", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1636673495, "updated_at": 1636715160, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1636715160, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "1.前言天命之子的暴击机制不同于普通的MMORPG游戏机制，无论上阵多少天子，一次的暴击状态只能由一位天子触发，并且当达到一定时限后，暴击状态会消失，此时出手不会触发暴击，因此，如韩服雷萍【鲁邦】具有", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 1, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 3934, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 91937, "content": "<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">1.前言</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 天命之子的暴击机制不同于普通的<span style=\"font-size:14px;text-indent:28px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">MMORPG游戏机制，<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">无论上阵多少天子，一次的暴击状态只能由一位天子触发，并且当达到一定时限后，暴击状态会消失，此时出手不会触发暴击</span>，因此，如韩服雷萍【鲁邦】具有的暴击抑制，虽然是抑制除刀以外的天子暴击率，却属于增益buff。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">2.暴击公式</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">公式由楼主本人使用了泡面和不同进化星级下的天子，调整不同数值，进行了上百次的独立重复测试验证，</span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"></div><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">暴击公式：<br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\">（面板暴击×<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">0.01</span></span>）<span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\">×</span></span></span></span></span></span>（0.1<span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\">×</span></span>进化星级）+buff=实际暴击率【5-6星】</span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\">（面板暴击<span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\">×</span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">0.01</span></span>）+buff=实际暴击率【1-4星】</span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span><span style=\"\"></span></span><span style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;\">ps：注意，<span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">1-4星天子通过进化</span></span></span>升到5<span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">-6</span></span>星后套用的是第一条公式。进化星级指的是天子当前星级，例<span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">如<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">三星达比进化到六星，它的<span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">初始星级是3，</span></span>进化星级是6</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">3.尾言</span></p></div><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 需要注意的是，</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;\">只有ts和ss技能才能触发暴击，普通攻击和ds技能都不会触发暴击。并且天子是拥有</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;\">暴击防御的</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">（其等同于额外增伤，只不过为负值）</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;\">，当暴击防御高到一定程度，</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;\">暴击数值可能还没有不暴击的伤害高<span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">，</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16px;\">也正因如此，建议大家不要提前点集中刀，等boss信息出来再点，防止策划背刺。</span><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">——ID：xiaoxin</font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">2021.11.11</font></p></span></span></span></span></div></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gameke